{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑い中、部活やお仕事、そして勉強など頑張っている方！\nお疲れ様です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"更新遅れてごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なるべく気を付けるねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今隣で、\nれなりんが、目頭を引っ張って、\n笑わせてくるー！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『はりょー(はろー)ないしゅちゅみーちゅー！(ナイストゥミートゥー)』\nっていってくるー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてれなりんさんは天然だから、今日は普通に歩いてて、\n大きな鉄の黒い変なやつにお顔、思いきりぶつけてた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"気を付けてー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いたいよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もぅなんか、れなりんとはラブラブよーんっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫の衣装"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか今月はまあやさんの\n乃木坂浪漫！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"パルコ劇場での公演！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやパラダイスだねぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ニコニコ(o^−^o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く皆様にあいたいよ〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浪漫の時の撮影現場です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"見逃したよっ！(*^^*)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って方はインターネットでみてちょっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\nオンプ書いてるシーンがあったでしょ？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほらっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！この写メは、楽譜にカメラマンさんの似顔絵を書いてるんだッ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上手でしょ？\nえぇー？見えないってー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オンプかかなきゃだめってぇー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しょーがないなぁー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っとかいってみる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問回答コーナー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q 徳島にはなにもなかったでしょ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A いえいえー！徳島ラーメン！めっちゃおおしかったです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q会場にはまあやのファン以外の人もいるから自己紹介のしかたおしえてあげて！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A まあやが、Hello！っていったら！Hello！っていって！\nはーわーゆー？\nって聞いたら、元気じゃなくても、アイムファインThank You！っていってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qゴーヤたべれる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A ばぁちゃんの作ったものならたべれるー！（あっ...お母さんに怒られそうだ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qいつか広島でもライブしてほしいな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A そうですね！\nできるといいな！もっとしってもらいたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q目覚ましライブの後半に前髪アップに変わったの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A えーッと！Zeppの時ですよね？\n前髪あげましたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qポパイのこと知ってる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A しりませんー！涙\nなんですかー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q あまりに可愛いので妹にしたいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A 妹にするにはまあやの許可がいるよー！\nどーしよっかなぁー！笑笑笑\n嬉し〜い！！照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q夏休みも終わりだけどどっか遊びにいった？しゅくだいやった？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A１日だけ、地元にかえったよー！\n後は、乃木充してました！\n宿題？\n後は、数学少し残ってるけど、今日中にやろうとおもいますー笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Qオリンピックでは何が一番感動した？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A どれも素晴らしかったのてすが、やっぱりサッカーですかねぇー！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"QAKB48の『いってらっしゃい』\nがまあやの歌"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A ほんとですかー？今から聞いてみますー！ありがとう！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、個別握手会もありますね！\nその時に、私のヘアーに注目してみてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これない方写メをのせるので良かったら見て下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂浪漫の感想ありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだまだ質問返ししますので、待ってて下さい\nいつもコメント楽しみに読んでます！\n本当にありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/08/31/6520039/0000.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}